# Landfall - Whenever a land you control enters, double the power of target creature you control until end of turn (CR 701.10b-c).
# Bot1 casts Mightform Harmonizer (4/4) with four Mox Emeralds, then plays Wooded Foothills: that land entering doubles the
# Harmonizer to 8; cracking the Foothills puts a Forest onto the battlefield, a second land entering, which doubles it again to
# 16, the power it has as the second ability resolves. Toughness is untouched. It lasts through the turn (checked in the
# second main phase) and ends at cleanup: on turn 3 it is a 4/4 again.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Emerald
Mox Emerald
Mox Emerald
Mox Emerald
Mightform Harmonizer
Wooded Foothills
Island
Forest x13

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x20

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Mox Emerald.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Emerald.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Emerald.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Emerald.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Emerald#1.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Emerald#2.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Emerald#3.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Emerald#4.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Mightform Harmonizer.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
? Bot1.Battlefield.Mightform Harmonizer.Power = 4
Bot1.Hand.Wooded Foothills.Play
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
? Bot1.Battlefield.Mightform Harmonizer.Power = 8
Bot1.Battlefield.Wooded Foothills.Activate
Bot1.Search(Forest)
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
[T1 Bot1.Main2]
? Bot1.Battlefield.Mightform Harmonizer.Power = 16
? Bot1.Battlefield.Mightform Harmonizer.Toughness = 4
[T3 Bot1.Main1]

[Expect]
Bot1.Battlefield.Mightform Harmonizer.Power = 4
Bot1.Battlefield.Mightform Harmonizer.Toughness = 4
Bot1.Battlefield.Forest.Tapped = false
